{"id":"n49688-1-8","stage":4,"title":"딱하다 · 可怜","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49688-1-8-1","ko":"같은 반 친구의 부모님이 교통사고로 돌아가셨대요.","zh":"听说同班同学的父母因为交通事故去世了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"같은","meaning":"相似，如同，像","explanation":"같다：相似，如同，像；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"2","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같은","audio":"/audio/9dce73570f65f8a11961.mp3"}},{"text":"반","meaning":"班，班级","explanation":"반：班，班级","readings":[{"term":"반","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57301","senseId":"2","lemma":"반","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3"}},{"text":"친구의","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구의","audio":"/audio/89d1c15c6226a38d288d.mp3"}},{"text":"부모님이","meaning":"父母","explanation":"부모님：父母；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"부모님","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62272","senseId":"1","lemma":"부모님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부모님이","audio":"/audio/7f3cf589d922be64a074.mp3"}},{"text":"교통사고로","meaning":"交通事故","explanation":"교통사고：交通事故；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"교통사고","audio":"/audio/28bb225f685ceba3c5b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"35968","senseId":"1","lemma":"교통사고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"교통사고로","audio":"/audio/e4750760b0f99e33cb56.mp3"}},{"text":"돌아가셨대요.","meaning":"去世，逝世","explanation":"돌아가다：去世，逝世；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"돌아